WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.086
Bat saw something brown.

2
00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:30.356
He went to tell Cow.

3
00:00:30.357 --> 00:00:35.738
"I saw something brown," said Bat.

4
00:00:35.739 --> 00:00:44.059
"Is it a hat?" said Cow.

5
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.931
"It is not a hat," said Bat.

6
00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:52.970
He went to Pig.

7
00:00:52.971 --> 00:00:57.132
"I saw something brown and hard," said Bat.

8
00:00:57.133 --> 00:01:01.051
"It's not a hat."

9
00:01:01.052 --> 00:01:03.910
"Is it a box?" said Pig.

10
00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:10.196
"A box is brown and hard."

11
00:01:10.197 --> 00:01:14.770
"It is not a box," said Bat.

12
00:01:14.771 --> 00:01:17.966
Bat went to Cat.

13
00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:21.444
"I saw something in the barn," said Bat.

14
00:01:21.445 --> 00:01:30.793
"It is brown and hard and small.

15
00:01:30.794 --> 00:01:36.812
It is not a hat or a box."

16
00:01:36.813 --> 00:01:40.418
"Is it a rock?" said Cat.

17
00:01:40.419 --> 00:01:43.794
"A rock is brown and hard.

18
00:01:43.795 --> 00:01:49.978
A rock can be small too," Cat said.

19
00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:58.447
"It is not a rock," said Bat.

20
00:01:58.448 --> 00:02:06.908
Bat went back to the barn.

21
00:02:06.909 --> 00:02:12.303
What was this thing?

